Usage: chimera [OPTIONS] [COMMAND] [ARGS]...

  Chimera — dynamic multi-model deliberation gateway.

Options:
  --version             Show the version and exit.
  -f, --formation TEXT  Formation preset name.
  -v, --verbose         Print the full trace.
  --quiet               Print only the raw answer to stdout (warnings go to
                        stderr).
  --json                Print one JSON object (answer + full trace) to stdout.
  -c, --config TEXT     Path to chimera.yaml (overrides the CHIMERA_CONFIG env
                        var and the cwd search).
  --allow-custom-dag    Accept a client-defined DAG (requires --dag).
  --dag TEXT            Client-defined DAG as a JSON string ({stages:[...],
                        edges:[[a,b]]}).
  --stage-models TEXT   Per-stage model overrides as JSON (e.g.
                        '{"worker_1":"zai-coding-plan/glm-5.2"}'); unknown
                        stage ids are rejected.
  --help                Show this message and exit.

Commands:
  config      Configuration helpers.
  formations  List available formation presets.
  mcp         Run the MCP server over stdio.
  models      List available models with category weights.
  run         Run a full deliberation for PROMPT (default when no...
  serve       Run the REST API server.
